about: Deletes all database entries
arg: -f/--force help: Bypasses the interactive confirmation and drops the database directly

== op-reth db clear
about: Deletes all table entries

== op-reth db clear mdbx
about: Deletes all database table entries
arg: [positional: table] <TABLE> [required]

== op-reth db clear static-file
about: Deletes all static file segment entries
arg: [positional: segment] <SEGMENT> [possible: headers, transactions, receipts, transaction-senders, account-change-sets, storage-change-sets] [required]

